{"uid":"dd0d6f57ee6f3939","name":"test_every_table_has_somewhere_to_scroll","fullName":"tests.test_docs_layout_contract#test_every_table_has_somewhere_to_scroll","historyId":"b542f5c882f0aae67df1729e38fdab01","time":{"start":1789509908804,"stop":1789509908806,"duration":2},"description":"A table at its natural width needs a scroll container, or the page scrolls.\n\n    Generated tables sit inside ``.table-wrap``, which scrolls. Hand-authored\n    pages have bare ``<table>`` elements that do not — and once cells stopped\n    being crushed, one of those pushed ``walkthrough.html`` into 38px of\n    horizontal *page* scroll at 390px wide. The stylesheet carries a rule making\n    any unwrapped table its own scroll container; this asserts it stays.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A table at its natural width needs a scroll container, or the page scrolls.</p>\n<pre><code>Generated tables sit inside ``.table-wrap``, which scrolls. Hand-authored\npages have bare ``&lt;table&gt;`` elements that do not — and once cells stopped\nbeing crushed, one of those pushed ``walkthrough.html`` into 38px of\nhorizontal *page* scroll at 390px wide. The stylesheet carries a rule making\nany unwrapped table its own scroll container; this asserts it stays.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789509479273,"stop":1789509479274,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_default_tests_to_trusted_header_auth","time":{"start":1789509908800,"stop":1789509908801,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time